    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-gray-900 tracking-tight leading-tight mb-6">
      Simplifying Nigerian stock investing for
      <span class="text-navy-700">everyone</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 font-light max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
      NoraCapital was built to bridge the gap between complex financial data and everyday Nigerian investors who deserve accessible, clear, and actionable market intelligence.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- Mission & Vision -->
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mt-8">
  <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-8 hover:border-navy-300 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-navy-100 transition-all duration-300">
